* Zsh on debian does not implement loading of 3rd party config files.
So, see debian/postinst how we append into /etc/zsh/zshenv

that sources the /etc/env file which is in the maruska-preference file.


* /etc/zsh/zshrc
here we are interactive, so load my widgets, here defined.
from /usr/share/zsh/site-functions/rc
